Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.27,0:00:05.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.65,0:00:07.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.02,0:00:11.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow!\NCome on, you two, stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.48,0:00:12.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.53,0:00:14.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba? Did you find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.65,0:00:18.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I couldn't.\NDammit, where'd he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.45,0:00:20.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go?\NHe go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.99,0:00:24.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Going somewhere with a lot of people might have been a mistake...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:28.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We said we'd go to the shrine on New Year's as the CRC last year, didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.38,0:00:29.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Didn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:31.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Din' we!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.67,0:00:33.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you little brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.80,0:00:35.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Inaba Nee-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.05,0:00:37.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I bought some {\i1}takoyaki{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.18,0:00:44.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should've told me {\i1}before{\i0} you bought them!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.89,0:00:47.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, that doesn't matter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.77,0:00:50.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi.\NCome on. Open your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.07,0:00:53.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got your hands full.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.90,0:00:56.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not really. I can let go...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.87,0:01:07.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:14.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence, Inaba-san, Yaegashi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.21,0:01:16.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And Happy New Year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.59,0:01:17.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fujishima...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.01,0:01:21.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you two paying a shrine visit together?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.81,0:01:23.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who are those kids?{Obviously, they're Taichi and Inaba's.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.22,0:01:27.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're relatives, you know? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.48,0:01:32.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We said we were going to the shrine as the CRC, and they dumped these kids on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.48,0:01:34.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. That's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.48,0:01:37.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.48,0:01:39.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This girl looks an awful lot like Nagase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.70,0:01:41.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like if Nagase-san went back to being a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.99,0:01:45.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry! We have to go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.20,0:01:47.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hey, wait—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.54,0:01:49.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.29,0:01:51.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.58,0:01:52.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{Aoki}Hey, I want one of these!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.59,0:01:55.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why'd it turn out like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.71,0:01:55.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{overlap}I'll get you one later!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.55,0:02:05.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For a while after the whole "desire unleashing" thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.02,0:02:10.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we were able to live our lives in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.19,0:02:15.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}I haven't resolved the whole issue with Inaba and Nagase,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:19.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but nothing's changed between us since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.03,0:02:24.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But on the last day of school before winter break...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.41,0:02:27.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.20,0:02:30.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was on there when we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.37,0:02:33.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But no one here knows who wrote it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.88,0:02:36.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's almost 12...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.01,0:02:41.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Nagase?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.13,0:02:44.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My body feels hot...{Oh dear. Why's that?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.35,0:02:46.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm hot, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.90,0:02:55.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.69,0:02:58.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Flop! Flop! Flop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.19,0:03:01.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Snacks!\NCan I have some?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.24,0:03:03.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.20,0:03:04.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.62,0:03:08.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's eat them together.\N{missing}Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.33,0:03:11.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:15.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know.\NIs there something wrong with my eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.79,0:03:18.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something wrong with my eyes?\NThat has to be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.46,0:03:22.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll close my eyes.\NWhen I open them, everything will be normal again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.22,0:03:25.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, open!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.10,0:03:28.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Still not normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.48,0:03:37.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!{Holy electric cow batman!}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.94,0:03:44.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then I'll ask again.\NWhat's your name, and how old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.49,0:03:48.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!\NKiriyama Yui! I'm eleven!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:51.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase Iori. Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.66,0:03:57.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, next question.\NWho's this lanky guy with the dirty mind here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.34,0:03:58.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aoki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.59,0:04:00.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aoki Onii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.26,0:04:01.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't need to say "dirty mind"!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.88,0:04:06.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then who's this kind of handsome guy here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.88,0:04:06.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.68,0:04:08.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi Onii-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.30,0:04:12.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I get a compliment, Inaba-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.43,0:04:17.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, do you two know why you're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:18.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.07,0:04:20.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And there we have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.28,0:04:24.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell {\i1}do{\i0} we have here?! This makes {\i1}no{\i0} sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.36,0:04:27.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So Nagase and Kiriyama got younger?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:32.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NThey're back to the way they were as kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.41,0:04:36.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They don't know why or how they got here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.12,0:04:40.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but they do have a vague idea of what's going on around them,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.21,0:04:43.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,so they don't have any problems with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.30,0:04:46.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though they don't really get it.\N{missing}Or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.72,0:04:49.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You think it's Balloon Vine again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.89,0:04:51.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the only possibility I can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.64,0:04:56.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.23,0:04:58.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.44,0:04:59.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.02,0:05:03.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?\NWhat's my skirt doing up this high?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.11,0:05:05.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Iori-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.49,0:05:07.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're here, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:09.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then don't look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.58,0:05:17.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So we can probably call it "time regression" this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.62,0:05:21.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you remember anything from when you turned into a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.71,0:05:24.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.34,0:05:28.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}But my memories from then feel kind of fresh in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.34,0:05:32.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like playing with friends and going to school,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.76,0:05:35.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and stuff at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.48,0:05:40.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For me, it's what I was like back in fifth grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.19,0:05:44.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was so bright and breezy.\NIt makes me kind of sad now.{Ideas for frustrated, but not knowing that it's frustration?}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.44,0:05:47.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And winter break starts tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.99,0:05:50.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What if we turn into kids in front of our families?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.78,0:05:54.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It said twelve to five on the board.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.79,0:05:57.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it only happens between those times,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.08,0:06:01.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we might be able to deal with it if we can find somewhere to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:06.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}For now, that writing on the blackboard's all we can go by.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.84,0:06:09.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's a building scheduled for demolition by my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.09,0:06:12.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's meet there tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.35,0:06:15.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm ho—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.81,0:06:18.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Onii-chan, what took you?{RINAAAAAAAAA HNNNNNNNNNGGGGGG}{HNNNNNGGGGG}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.14,0:06:21.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I have stuff I need to do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:26.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something more important than your cute little sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.23,0:06:30.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it {\i1}is{\i0} Christmas, and you {\i1}do{\i0} have a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.45,0:06:32.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you have a {\i1}lot{\i0} of stuff to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.57,0:06:34.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you, I don't have a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.78,0:06:39.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, we came close to being in a situation like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.41,0:06:42.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but now's not the time for that, or something like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:45.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you didn't give her a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.42,0:06:47.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you, it's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.84,0:06:49.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, hold on, Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.06,0:07:00.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Balloon Vine?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.39,0:07:04.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.\NBalloon Vine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.69,0:07:06.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.82,0:07:10.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can call me The Second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.45,0:07:12.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.45,0:07:15.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you Balloon Vine or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.62,0:07:18.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am Balloon Vine,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.16,0:07:22.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but not the Balloon Vine you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.21,0:07:24.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I'm The Second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:28.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So you're part of Balloon Vine's ilk,\Nbut you're not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.46,0:07:32.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want you to be a knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.05,0:07:34.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{missing}Knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.76,0:07:40.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you all turn into kids, it'll be bad.\NThere's no way to deal with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:45.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Your job is to make sure nothing bad happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:48.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll... watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.19,0:07:51.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It won't be too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.94,0:07:55.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But don't tell anyone about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.28,0:08:01.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you do...\NI'll make twelve to five into forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.25,0:08:05.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?!\NHow are you related to Balloon Vine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.12,0:08:09.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was I doing just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.34,0:08:15.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did I really turn completely into a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.68,0:08:18.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:21.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.47,0:08:26.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Do you think Taichi won't like me anymore now that he's seen me as a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.56,0:08:32.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's not that kind of person.\NI think.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:35.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right. I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.79,0:08:44.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is {\i1}with{\i0} this conversation?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.16,0:08:47.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}It's weird enough that we'd talk about something like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.12,0:08:51.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but when we love the same person, too?\NThis has to be a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.55,0:08:53.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.59,0:08:58.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I never thought a day would come when I'd talk about this with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.55,0:09:02.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, my mom's back home.\NBye, Inaban. See you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.27,0:09:04.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, see—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.06,0:09:10.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way! Why'd you quit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.15,0:09:12.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Some... stuff happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.73,0:09:15.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But what about our promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.40,0:09:16.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.74,0:09:20.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, our promise!\NThat promise we made!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.12,0:09:24.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.75,0:09:27.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey. A friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:32.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Mihashi Chinatsu-san.\NA friend from back when I practiced karate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:35.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is Yaegashi Taichi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.34,0:09:37.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What, your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.43,0:09:40.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, we're just on our way to a friend's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.55,0:09:42.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's not my boyfriend.\NYeah. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.97,0:09:45.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's absolutely, positively not my boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.22,0:09:46.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think she gets the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.77,0:09:48.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry, we're in a hurry, so see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.02,0:09:50.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Kiriyama...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.23,0:09:55.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll never accept this, Kiriyama!{Less trite way to phrase this?}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.69,0:10:00.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I went up against Mihashi-san in a lot of tournaments.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.32,0:10:03.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's more like a rival than a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.41,0:10:09.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A rival?\NThat's pretty crazy.\NThat's the kind of world you were in...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.42,0:10:11.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:14.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But I haven't seen her since she moved away,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.88,0:10:16.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and I stopped practicing karate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:19.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She said something about a promise?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.30,0:10:23.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NBut I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.27,0:10:30.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly fine. How are you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.73,0:10:34.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.\NI'll be home as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.78,0:10:37.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.65,0:10:41.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi! Yui! Morning!\NWhy are you together?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.86,0:10:46.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi, don't tell me you're going to take down Yui now that you've got Inaban!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.74,0:10:49.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now that he's got Inaban? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.54,0:10:51.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing, Kiriyama!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:11:00.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, this place is pretty nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.55,0:11:02.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}You really think someone's going to turn into a kid today?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.09,0:11:07.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I still can't really believe it...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.61,0:11:17.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.82,0:11:20.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.40,0:11:22.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.12,0:11:33.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's too cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:37.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can see the resemblance to the cool beauty she'll be in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:41.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but she still has that cuteness that only kids have!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.25,0:11:41.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.25,0:11:43.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just {\i1}thinking{\i0} that this is Inaban...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:43.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}have{\i0} to have her!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.76,0:11:49.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be panicking?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.73,0:11:54.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Girls are {\i1}scary{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.73,0:11:58.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm stuffed...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.73,0:12:04.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My cuteium reserves are fully charged now...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.07,0:12:04.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two need to learn some self-control.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.53,0:12:07.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now she's totally afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.49,0:12:10.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}do{\i0} feel bad about it...\NSame here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.41,0:12:12.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that, Himeko-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.75,0:12:18.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3\i1}N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:21.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't let myself experience what Nagase and Kiriyama just did!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.88,0:12:22.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Himeko-chan, what do you want to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.18,0:12:29.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Orange.{Because they spelled it that way?}\NOkay. Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.72,0:12:31.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, one second...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.93,0:12:35.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here.\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.39,0:12:39.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want cola!\N{missing}Here you go.\N{missing}Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.27,0:12:42.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Nana's sister!\NNana?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.78,0:12:44.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're Nana's sister, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.78,0:12:47.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.90,0:12:47.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.82,0:12:51.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yoshifumi-kun, do you know my full name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.20,0:12:52.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yaegashi Taichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.16,0:12:54.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then what about hers?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.45,0:12:55.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase Iori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.50,0:12:58.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then what about hers?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:13:02.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She isn't Nishino Nana's big sister?\NUm...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.21,0:13:06.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm Kiriyama Yui...\NKiriyama Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.55,0:13:07.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.05,0:13:10.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You look just like her...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.89,0:13:13.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Very good, Himeko-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.68,0:13:18.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can already write your own name!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.27,0:13:18.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.02,0:13:26.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You can see Inaba's brilliant mind already taking shape!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.65,0:13:26.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There! I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.15,0:13:29.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm faster than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:29.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dang!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.03,0:13:34.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What were you two doing?\NExploring the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.25,0:13:38.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And a race.\NI won!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.21,0:13:41.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're so immature! That's why you haven't kissed anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.71,0:13:43.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I said that I've kissed before!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:46.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What were you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.80,0:13:49.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, sure, I was Inaban at the time, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.51,0:13:55.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it was me inside there, so that was my first kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.97,0:13:55.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've decided!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.93,0:13:58.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,N-Nagase, don't say any more...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:03.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Should I have just heard that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.48,0:14:03.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's a kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.48,0:14:06.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're too young for this, Himeko-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.69,0:14:06.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is grown-up talk!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.65,0:14:11.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Will I be a grown-up if I kiss?\NIt's not really like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.57,0:14:14.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}It's more like something you do {\i1}when{\i0} you're a grown-up...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.57,0:14:20.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When will I kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.74,0:14:20.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the latest, the fall of your first year in high—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.33,0:14:22.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.09,0:14:25.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. What about clothes?\NHuh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.96,0:14:28.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, what happens to our clothes when we go back to normal?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.17,0:14:30.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They stay on you, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.93,0:14:32.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:34.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They need to change clothes, now!\NTaichi, move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.97,0:14:36.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.97,0:14:38.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Himeko-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.14,0:14:40.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.90,0:14:43.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry!\NFor now, turn around and close your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.73,0:14:44.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that works.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.94,0:14:47.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You too, Yoshifumi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.23,0:14:50.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh no! We won't make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.23,0:14:53.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.53,0:14:53.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These clothes are too tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.53,0:14:56.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.91,0:14:56.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why am I naked?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.45,0:14:59.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I-I-Inaban!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why am I naked?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.54,0:15:02.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop, stop, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:05.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I was ten years old?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:12.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not having any memories of those five hours is {\i1}way{\i0} too disturbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.42,0:15:17.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like the blackboard really was a clue from Balloon Vine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.97,0:15:20.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then having only four of our names on the board must mean something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.89,0:15:23.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe Taichi won't get time regressed?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.35,0:15:30.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Balloon Vine'll probably show himself and explain all this soon enough, but it's taking him way too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.57,0:15:34.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, whose is this? Can I drink it?\NHey, quick question.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.03,0:15:38.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know someone named Nishino Nana?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.20,0:15:43.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wait, Yui, how do you know about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.20,0:15:45.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When you were ten years old, you thought that I was Nishino Nana's big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.71,0:15:48.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You said I looked just like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.13,0:15:55.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She was a girl who lived near me. We're the same age.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.67,0:15:59.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I dated her in my first year of middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.60,0:16:02.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But at the end of that first year, Nana had to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.81,0:16:08.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Since then, all we've done is exchange New Year's cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.06,0:16:08.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.06,0:16:10.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you think she'd look like me if she were in high school?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.28,0:16:13.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.95,0:16:15.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't that like...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.87,0:16:33.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You... weren't acting like yourself back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.17,0:16:37.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought you would say something like,\N"But that doesn't matter! I love you!"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.51,0:16:42.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just on the spur of the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.51,0:16:44.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You haven't had a time regression yet, so you don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.73,0:16:50.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but your memories from back then feel really fresh in your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.90,0:16:55.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's confusing the heck out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.65,0:16:55.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Confusing the heck out of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.65,0:17:00.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, I remember how much I loved Nana back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.16,0:17:03.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't say I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.87,0:17:07.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.87,0:17:12.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But back then, I was in love with Nana.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.04,0:17:18.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then when did I stop loving Nana?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.67,0:17:18.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is it gone forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.76,0:17:23.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Or is it still there?\NHey, Taichi...\NWhat does it mean to love someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.15,0:17:34.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Onee?\NWhat is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.57,0:17:37.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.57,0:17:40.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You hated looking at those things ever since you stopped practicing karate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.32,0:17:43.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nothing. I was just remembering a few things from the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:45.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. I ran into Mihashi-san today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.75,0:17:49.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here, this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.75,0:17:53.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I talked to her quite a bit back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.71,0:17:56.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}She said she was staying with some relatives in town right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.51,0:18:00.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Though it's only for winter break.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.84,0:18:00.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.97,0:18:05.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Onee, why'd you stop practicing karate?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.14,0:18:08.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I loved how cool you looked back when you did karate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.77,0:18:12.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Onee?\NWhat's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.98,0:18:15.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did I say something bad?\NSorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.57,0:18:18.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, Onee...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.78,0:18:26.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.66,0:18:29.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi!\NWhat a coincidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.50,0:18:31.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're headed to the same place,\Nso of course we'd run into each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.55,0:18:40.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi, can I ask you a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.76,0:18:40.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.84,0:18:44.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You don't need to look too deep,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.84,0:18:46.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but could you pay attention to how I was as a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.56,0:18:49.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Like, what kind of kid I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.56,0:18:56.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}You mean, you want to know what kind of person you were back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.27,0:18:56.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.57,0:19:00.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't really want to think too hard about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.57,0:19:01.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But when you're actually in a situation like this, it's hard not to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:07.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you had a chance to relive your past,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.87,0:19:10.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,would you do something different, Taichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.16,0:19:18.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}There are a lot of times that I think "If only I'd done that," but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.62,0:19:22.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I could relive mine, I think I'd do things differently.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.17,0:19:26.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And if I could do things better, I'd want to do them better.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.18,0:19:29.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aoki Yoshifumi, eleven!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.89,0:19:33.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nagase Iori, fourteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.27,0:19:35.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's really cold outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.02,0:19:38.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Want to wear my gloves, Iori-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.98,0:19:41.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{missing}Don't worry about me, Taichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.65,0:19:43.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No need to be reserved.\NHere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.03,0:19:46.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:50.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're so warm!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.04,0:19:54.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, don't {\i1}you{\i0} look {\i1}happy{\i0}.\NThen as thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.92,0:19:59.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I love you, Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.63,0:19:59.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"O-Onii-chan"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.34,0:20:03.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I thought you liked being called "Onii-chan," Taichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.72,0:20:05.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, I do... but how did you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.84,0:20:08.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A woman's intuition, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.85,0:20:12.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How frightening!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.85,0:20:17.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is this how Nagase was back when she would change her personality to what people around her wanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.94,0:20:19.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How long are you going to keep grinning like an idiot,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.11,0:20:23.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Onii-chan"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.23,0:20:24.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My, you're in perfect sync!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.65,0:20:27.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're almost like boyfriend and girlfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.08,0:20:32.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Taichi and me look like boyfriend and girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.08,0:20:32.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.\NI-I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.70,0:20:35.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're a good kid, Iori-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.87,0:20:37.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.38,0:20:39.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll buy you something you want later!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.84,0:20:40.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.42,0:20:41.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.17,0:20:42.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What should I get?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.72,0:20:44.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's even got Inaba under her thumb...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.55,0:20:44.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Anything you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.01,0:20:47.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why don't we get something that everyone can enjoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.43,0:20:47.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is this the real fourteen-year-old Nagase Iori?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.97,0:20:59.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\q3}Is that what Nagase calls "changing her personality depending on the situation"?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.27,0:20:59.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,By the way, what was I like when I was a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.98,0:21:06.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Was I as shy as I remember?\NYou were afraid of Nagase and Kiriyama,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.86,0:21:11.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but that was their fault...\NYou're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.08,0:21:13.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was always afraid of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.29,0:21:17.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And I still am.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.50,0:21:20.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone has something they don't want others to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.13,0:21:22.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are things you're better off not knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.30,0:21:30.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And maybe there are things you're better off not remembering about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.76,0:21:36.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But in this phenomenon, our past selves appear in complete form in the present.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:39.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One day, it might be the trigger for something that ruins us all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.14,0:21:44.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've been able to get through things together so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.02,0:21:44.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.32,0:21:48.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm scared, Taichi.\NI'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.16,0:21:56.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I told you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.33,0:21:57.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't remember making any promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.54,0:22:00.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, quit shaking.\NHas your mom asked you anything about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.54,0:22:03.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aoki, do you not love Yui anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.42,0:22:09.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... forgot to be laid-back!
